  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nFamilies, this is the one you've been waiting for. Set on a large freehold section and bathed in all-day northern sun, this four-bedroom, two-bathroom home offers the space, flexibility and location that are so hard to find together.\r\n\r\nWith two separate lounges, there's room for everyone to spread out: a place to relax together and a place to retreat when you need some quiet. Step outside to the sunny patio, made for summer barbecues, weekend brunches and long evenings with friends.\r\n\r\nThe garden is a genuine standout. There's plenty of space for kids to run, pets to play, room to park the boat or caravan, and even space to build a pool, so you'll never be squeezed for space again. With both a garage and a carport, there's secure parking and storage for the cars and all the family's gear.\r\n\r\nDownstairs adds real versatility. It could be a self-contained space for teenagers, a comfortable retreat for guests and extended family, or a potential income opportunity.\r\n\r\nThe lifestyle is hard to beat. You can stroll to beautiful Waiake Beach and the Torbay shops, and Long Bay Beach and the Browns Bay beachfront, cafés and shops are only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nIt's also in zone for Glamorgan School, Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nSpace, sunshine, flexibility and an unbeatable coastal location. Homes like this don't come along often, so don't miss your chance.\r\n\r\nContact us to arrange your viewing today.\r\n\r\nCheck out the property video via our Team Bren & Nicole Instagram page. \r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/teambrenandnicole?exln=MXkwbXdlaXVvc3gxbQ%3D%3D&utm_source=qr",
